📊 Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) Project
📝 Description

This project focuses on performing Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) on a dataset to uncover hidden patterns, detect anomalies, and visualize key insights.
Through data cleaning, statistical analysis, and visualization, the goal is to make the dataset ready for modeling and decision-making.

✨ Key Highlights:

🧹 Data Cleaning (handling missing values, outliers, duplicates)

📈 Descriptive Statistics & Data Distributions

🎨 Data Visualization (histograms, heatmaps, scatterplots, boxplots)

🔍 Correlation & Feature Relationships

🤖 Insights for Model Building

🏷️ Tags

EDA Data Analysis Python Pandas NumPy Matplotlib Seaborn Data Visualization Jupyter Notebook Machine Learning Prep
